23:47:13.000Z","2026-11-11T00:02:35.899Z",[101,155,156],{"_90":137,"_92":138,"_93":139,"_95":140,"_97":141,"_99":86,"_100":142},"Lingxi Li","lingxi","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2094044966863724544%2FzPvc_cDi_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=64c3ee8c0ccd039d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2094044966863724544%2FzPvc_cDi_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=9b0b9aa840fad48c 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2094044966863724544%2FzPvc_cDi_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=64c3ee8c0ccd039d 96w",[148],{"_90":143,"_92":144,"_145":146,"_147":-5},"Grok Bot","bot","text","Grok Bot can now join your personal or company tailnets on Tailscale.\n\nUse it to securely reach private MCP servers, internal tools, and apps on your network.","translation",{"_115":149,"_117":150,"_119":151,"_121":152,"_123":153,"_125":154,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"image","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzTiTMbEAAC-Xu.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=9c3749f4df7c0e6e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzTiTMbEAAC-Xu.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=d3de6ae14469b1b9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzTiTMbEAAC-Xu.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=e7837e23e8a882a4 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzTiTMbEAAC-Xu.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=9c3749f4df7c0e6e 720w",4096,3555,"MCP/工具调用","xAI","mebdpnegf8gtc55ss0mxwem0s","论文：递归自我改进安全性尚无共识","一篇论文指出，目前无人能断言递归自我改进（RSI）是安全的，因为连其走向都缺乏清晰的思考框架。作者仅用一条高层提示词就让 AI 从零训练出一个小型 LLM；在 FAR.AI 安全研讨会上，专家们因设想的结果不同，对 RSI 安全条件给出了截然不同的判断。其二人博弈模型显示，RSI 竞赛仅在部分风险水平下构成囚徒困境，高风险时双方共同克制是稳定结果。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-10T23:55:37.000Z","2026-11-11T00:12:37.306Z","paper",[177,178],{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":170,"_99":86,"_100":-5},"Rohan Paul","rohanpaul_ai","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FF