every teammate and their agents can now work together in one unified workspace.","Agent","knn6227b8ouhwvgz2be3nr2gp","Meta FAIR 发布 e-means 算法，以约十分之一轮数达到 Lloyd k-means 的损失并随 FAISS 1.16.0 开源","Meta FAIR 发布 e-means，一种用指数移动平均更新质心的 mini-batch k-means 算法，可在 1.4 到 2.6 个 epoch 达到 Lloyd k-means 25 个 epoch 的损失，已随 FAISS 1.16.0 以 MIT 许可发布于 faiss.contrib.e_means。",{"_103":208},"2026-11-10T23:20:19.000Z","2026-11-11T00:16:28.733Z",[177,207],56,"news","Meta","MarkTechPost","yobz9xil8yfibx3fepnrb8nrg","OpenRouter 实测教程：三种方法修复 OpenAI 与 Claude 的 429 限流错误","OpenRouter 发布教程，讲解如何修复 OpenAI 与 Claude API 的 429 限流错误，先读取 error.metadata.limit_source 判断是谁的限制，再对症处理。",{"_103":220},"2026-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","2026-11-11T00:21:29.444Z","tip",[218,219],65,"教程/实践","部署/工程","OpenRouter：Announcements","i3gp1xj4j11gi4qoreya18izb","OpenRouter 实测 fp8 与 fp4 量化对模型质量和价格的影响","OpenRouter 发布量化解析文章，讲解 LLM 量化原理，并报告 2026 年 10 月 20 日对 1455 个 provider 端点和 Qwen3.8 27B 六个端点的实测。","作者基于自家 280 个任务的实测数据讨论量化精度与价格的关系，并给出 provider.quantizations 的可操作用法，结论边界交代得清楚。",{"_103":220},"2026-11-11T00:21:29.451Z",[218,219],73,"wkpj021rmg6sgthgj9zwevei4","OpenRouter 实测 MCP vs CLI vs Skills 的上下文 token 成本","OpenRouter 实测同一 GitHub 任务下 MCP、CLI 与 skill 的 token 成本：在 Claude Sonnet 5.5 上 CLI 用 1。","原文实测同一 GitHub 任务下 MCP、CLI 与 skill 的 token 开销，给出缩窄工具和 Tool Search 的降本方法，可直接迁移到自己的智能体。",{"_103":220},"2026-11-11T00:21:29.458Z",[218,155],74,"wybngr5g8p05ojp6m139opvra","Cursor Projects 推出多人协作功能","Cursor 宣布在 Projects 中上线多人协作（multiplayer）功能，每个人拥有自己的 Agent，基于同一共享任务板和共享上下文工作。当某个 Agent 需要队友的工作成果时，会直接向队友的 Agent 发起请求。",{"_103":261},"2026-11-11T00:08:03.000Z","2026-11-11T00:30:32.166Z",[101,197],66,{"_90":250,"_92":251,"_93":252,"_95":253,"_97":254,"_99":86,"_100":-5},"sameEvent",{"_66":248,"_68":249},"vouc5yc5intvgg7311kekkhsi","Cursor Projects 升级为多人协作模式","matt palmer","mattyp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2111918243460030464%2FaVMpxoAo_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=af43f7c274d3f3f3","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2111918243460030464%2FaVMpxoAo_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=487692511caa04f9 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2111918243460030464%2FaVMpxoAo_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=af43f7c274d3f3f3 96w",[255],{"_115":116,"_117":256,"_119":257,"_121":258,"_123":259,"_125":260,"_127":-5,"_128":256},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=59773474cf5188fb","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=f371f0863b10adbc","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=ad4a09ae86add6a0 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=59773474cf5188fb 720w",3840,2160,"Matt Palmer","gdzcf3peltnvl291gs83f7cot","KORA Systems 发布原生 AI 操作系统 KORA OS，将率先适配高通骁龙 X2 Elite","KORA Systems 发布宣称首个\"自下而上\"专为 AI PC 设计的操作系统 KORA OS，基于 NixOS 构建，在系统底层融入智能体工作流、上下文记忆和本地 AI 推理。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T00:27:15.870Z","2026-11-11T00:49:28.364Z",[101,197,270,271],40,"端侧","推理","IT之家·人工智能","uzrjlisjtkb3dcbvar6x3cfnl","苹果子公司 Claris 测试 Harbor 应用：把 Mac 变成本地 AI 服务器","苹果全资子公司 Claris 正在测试 Harbor 应用，可将苹果芯片 Mac 变身本地 AI 服务器，单台即可运行，也能通过雷雳 5 接口连接多台 Mac 运行更大规模模型。该应用能自动检测雷雳 5 设备，支持浏览、下载开放权重模型，无需手动配置即可获得端侧 AI 能力。Harbor 仍处早期体验阶段，尚未向公众开放，此前曾现身 App Store 但页面已下架。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T00:25:48.767Z","2026-11-11T00:49:28.374Z",[101,270,281],46,"开源生态","rn6fdavm92v9f917jm1sfwdhf","谷歌更新 Android Bench 榜单：Kimi K3.1 Pro、DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 与 GPT-6.1 Terra 成绩揭晓","谷歌 Android Developers 首次公开 GPT-6.1 Terra、Kimi K3.1 Pro 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 在 Android Bench 的跑分。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T00:56:56.237Z","2026-11-11T01:09:20.597Z","ai-models",[291,292,293,294],41,"评测/基准","编码","Google","DeepSeek","m7ul4psbkb5zyp0t254fr986o","Anthropic 投资需求火热，承销商拟将 IPO 目标估值上调回 $1.5T 或更高","FT 报道，因投资者需求旺盛，Anthropic 承销商计划上调 IPO 定价，把目标估值拉回 $1.5T 或更高。周二文件设定 $70-$78 的发行区间，计入员工期权和受限股后对应 $1.26T-$1.41T 估值；若定价超出区间，募资将超过 $100B，其中 Google、Nvidia 和 Microsoft 将按 IPO 价格投资 $26B。","报道补充了定价区间、募资用途和三大科技公司的入股安排，可帮助读者理解这桩 IPO 的资金结构与定价逻辑。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T00:58:06.000Z","2026-11-11T01:14:24.726Z","industry",[316,317],85,{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":306,"_99":86,"_100":307},[310],{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_145":308,"_147":309},"Anthropic forges ahead with IPO roadshow\nThey will sell up to 825M shares at $70 to $78 each, a range that values it at as much as $1.4T.\n\nAt the top of that range the deal raises about $64.4B, and Anthropic itself takes roughly $62.5B from 801M new shares.\n\nExisting stockholders are selling only 23.6M shares, so almost all the cash funds the company instead of letting early investors exit.\n\nEarlier talk had pointed to as much as $2T, and the cut follows a tech selloff and midterm results showing voters souring on AI data centers.\n\nEven reduced, the price sits above the $1.25T private valuation OpenAI reached last week.\n\nShares are expected to start trading on Nasdaq under the ticker “ANT” as soon as Thursday or Friday next week.","Anthropic 推进 IPO 路演\n他们将以每股 70 至 78 美元的价格出售最多 8.25 亿股，该区间对公司的估值最高达 1.4 万亿美元。\n\n按该区间上限计算，此次交易募资约 644 亿美元，Anthropic 自身从 8.01 亿股新股中筹得约 625 亿美元。\n\n现有股东仅出售 2360 万股，因此几乎全部资金都流入公司，而非让早期投资者退出。\n\n早前传闻曾指向高达 2 万亿美元的估值，此次下调发生在科技股抛售以及中期选举结果显示选民对 AI 数据中心不满之后。\n\n即便下调，该价格仍高于 OpenAI 上周达到的 1.25 万亿美元私募估值。\n\n预计该股最早将于下周周四或周五在纳斯达克开始交易，股票代码为“ANT”。",{"_115":149,"_117":311,"_119":312,"_121":313,"_123":314,"_125":315,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=24fca0600b1e3d48","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=2c75f4a09eac86a1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=e971c397c28dc34c 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=24fca0600b1e3d48 720w",761,1026,"行业动态","Anthropic","a73jtskj9qghshz9b0pskrce2","CoreWeave 三季度营收增 168% 至 $3.66B，净亏损扩大至 $7.09 亿","CoreWeave 三季度营收同比增长 168% 至 $3.66B，但净亏损扩大逾 6 倍至 $7.09 亿，净利息支出升至 $846M。资本开支后现金消耗 $7.5B，合同积压升至 $132.5B，2026 年营收指引上调至 $13B-$13.3B；公司持有约 $4.12B 现金对近 $47B 债务，过去一个月股价跌超 40%，财报后盘后涨约 6%。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T00:53:50.000Z","2026-11-11T01:14:24.733Z",[316],{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":326,"_99":86,"_100":-5},[327],{"_115":149,"_117":328,"_119":329,"_121":330,"_123":331,"_125":332,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=dcd3140f15806e08","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=34db2551683a9a57","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=4ca7bfe669c9cd13 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=dcd3140f15806e08 720w",1025,931,"e4kab2ku3cujtz0fczna6fq07","Seedream 5.5 上线 ComfyUI Partner Nodes","Seedream 5.5 现已通过 Partner Nodes 在 ComfyUI 中可用，这是一个支持文本生成和图像编辑的多模态模型。能力方向包括原生 RGBA 透明生成、多轮局部编辑（只改描述区域、其余画面保持不变）、可读文字的海报与信息图排版、更真实的肖像质感以及提示词控光。",{"_103":341},"2026-11-11T00:42:03.000Z","2026-11-11T01:23:20.670Z",[101,340],"图像生成","Comfy Blog","q4uvrlk5c8jhveka0pzngb0mw","Anthropic 向 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户发放一次免费全量额度重置","Anthropic 为所有 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户提供一次免费全量重置，覆盖全部模型和限额，12月10日下午2:00（太平洋时间）前可随时使用。官方称此前修复的几个小问题曾多消耗额度，为补偿已用尽周限额的用户而发放，入口在 Settings > Usage 或 http://clau.de/reset。",{"_103":359},"2026-11-11T01:06:48.000Z","2026-11-11T01:30:22.669Z",[101,317],54,{"_90":351,"_92":352,"_93":353,"_95":354,"_97":355,"_99":86,"_100":356},"Ado","adocomplete","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=57846a058e5be3dd 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1 96w",[],{"_90":357,"_92":357,"_145":358,"_147":-5},"ClaudeDevs","We've given all Pro, Max, Ultra, and Team users one free full reset, across all models and limits. Use it anytime before December 10 at 2:00PM PT.\n\nWe recently fixed a few small issues that used more limits than intended, and the Fable resets didn't do much for those of you who'd already hit your weekly limits for all models. While these issues didn't affect everyone, we want to make up for the trouble.\n\nYou'll find it in Settings > Usage, or at http://clau.de/reset.","Ado Kukic","mrgpwu6mwuv4bxgvcgvpa4zll","PFN 小鼠尾静脉自动注射机器人 AUTiv 获第12届机器人大奖“日本机械工业联合会 会长奖”","Preferred Networks 设计开发的小鼠尾静脉自动注射系统 AUTiv 在第12届机器人大奖中获“日本机械工业联合会 会长奖”，评审认可其高精度给药、降低穿刺失误与实验者针刺事故风险。AUTiv 通过 4K 立体相机图像与深度学习识别尾静脉位置，可自动完成约 0.3mm 尾静脉穿刺与给药，国内已交付约 20 台并决定追加生产。",{"_103":369},"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","2026-11-11T01:30:22.824Z",[316,368],44,"具身智能","Preferred Networks：AI 研究与产品","dslz00n65ld89m3spp8r42f06","MiniCPM-OCR 接入 Hermes Agent","太棒了，Luis！🚀 很高兴看到 MiniCPM-OCR 集成进 Hermes Agent。感谢你构建并分享给社区！💙",{"_103":386},"2026-11-11T01:33:38.000Z","2026-11-11T01:43:23.038Z",[101,155],{"_90":378,"_92":378,"_93":379,"_95":380,"_97":381,"_99":86,"_100":382},"OpenBMB","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=0f090400f960fbf9 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b 96w",[],{"_90":383,"_92":384,"_145":385,"_147":-5},"Luis Poveda","povedaai","Introducing the MiniCPM-OCR plugin for Hermes Agent.\n\nThis is a problem I have experienced myself: LLMs by themselves are not always very good at OCR; sometimes I have needed another model specialized in it to solve complex document parsing.\n\nFor example, recently I have had difficulties understanding some physician recipes and other manuscripts.\n\nThis is where MiniCPM-OCR comes in. You can use the model and harness you already have to utilize a best-in-class OCR model by @OpenBMB.\n\n@Teknium @NousResearch \n\nCode: https://github.com/PovedaAqui/minicpm-ocr-hermes\nPR: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/150268","面壁智能 OpenBMB","ygrmt2d79ov5ppr361blm795b","简短提示词让小型开源模型 NLI 表现追平复杂方法","一篇论文发现，仅用带少量示例的简短直接提示词（In-Context Learning），小型开源 LLM 在自然语言推理（NLI）任务上就能追平更复杂的提示方法。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T01:39:00.000Z","2026-11-11T01:45:24.558Z",[177,271],{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":395,"_99":86,"_100":-5},[396],{"_115":149,"_117":397,"_119":398,"_121":399,"_123":400,"_125":401,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=7f69b59160ae6569","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=0fe5219c9c8f9813","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=a5d24b480aa08a8a 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=7f69b59160ae6569 720w",1596,1354,"n7ipl0zqvdowb2bei4eg44xsj","Khosla 押注 AI 为每位访客生成网页","Business Insider：Vinod Khosla 押注 AI 能让为每位访客单独构建网页变得足够便宜，而这一成本此前一直使网站保持静态。\n\nKhosla Ventures 联合领投了 Coframe 的 2500 万美元融资，用 AI 为每位访客生成页面来取代静态网站。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T01:24:56.000Z","2026-11-11T01:45:24.565Z",[316],48,{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":411,"_99":86,"_100":-5},[412],{"_115":149,"_117":413,"_119":414,"_121":415,"_123":416,"_125":417,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=2432cbab82ca5b1a","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=7cd1f0970308cdc2","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=a1e04e0674c9e3e5 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=2432cbab82ca5b1a 720w",755,902,"n2oqfdjfmgfr55upx4whlv56v","微软正式发布 .NET 11：开发更省时，AI 工具更齐全","微软在 .NET Conf 2026 线上大会正式发布 .NET 11，围绕运行性能、开发效率与 AI 应用构建推出更新，覆盖网页、移动端和桌面开发。新版带来数百项运行时与基础库优化，开发工具包内置 MCP 服务器模板，配套 AI 库与智能体框架支持模型接入、工具调用和工作流编排。C# 15 新增联合类型，.NET MAUI 默认采用 CoreCLR 运行时；该版本提供两年支持。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T01:23:02.620Z","2026-11-11T01:49:20.061Z",[101,155,425],"Microsoft","hl9vucjaloy0llz9kuc9kmvx3","Anthropic 为 Claude Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户免费重置额度，并扩大 MCP Apps 支持","Anthropic 宣布为 Claude Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户提供一次覆盖所有模型和使用限制的免费完整额度重置，以弥补此前 Bug 导致的词元超额消耗，太平洋时间 12 月 10 日下午 2 点前可在 Settings > Usage 或 claude.de/reset 领取。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T01:51:02.380Z","2026-11-11T02:08:35.008Z",[101,155,317],"l2ubk650ecfqppij0h3498iv4","ACE Music v1 在 AA-Music-Vocal v1.1 榜单登顶，超过 Suno v6","ACE Studio 的 ACE Music v1 在 Artificial Analysis AA-Music-Vocal v1.1 榜单首秀即排第一，领先 Suno v6。",{"_103":442},"2026-11-11T02:06:26.000Z","2026-11-11T02:31:38.805Z",[291,453],52,{"_90":442,"_92":443,"_93":444,"_95":445,"_97":446,"_99":86,"_100":-5},"Artificial Analysis","ArtificialAnlys","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5fe737d3f11168a8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2