 Qwen4 即将发布，称知识理解更深入、世界感知更立体，Coding 与 Agentic 能力持续进阶。Qwen4-Max 预览版已首发上线阿里 Token Plan，限时最低 1 折可体验；千问办公、Qoder、千问 App、QwenStudio 等已接入新模型。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T02:10:29.663Z","2026-11-11T02:48:24.723Z",[479],62,"模型发布","qkzvg84jth5fx1k2yiqkkaxhr","SpaceX 与 SINGULUS 签约引进 HJT 太阳能电池产线，支持超 100GW 设备规模生产 Starmind 卫星","SpaceX 11 月 11 日宣布与德国太阳能设备制造商 SINGULUS 签署重大供应合同，引进异质结（HJT）太阳能电池整套生产线，为得州工厂加速制造 Starmind 太空 AI 计算卫星提供电池供应。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T02:53:33.477Z","2026-11-11T03:27:39.842Z",[316,156],"toajz2icztxxscbv2l1k3ascx","Qwen4 预览版上线千问APP，千问Go!会员可抢先体验","千问APP已同步接入Qwen4-Max预览版，用户通过千问Go!即可抢先体验。全新一代千问大模型Qwen4即将发布，知识理解、世界感知以及Coding与Agentic能力均有进阶。11月11日起千问Go!会员推出限时折扣，最低9.9元。",{"_103":495},"2026-11-11T03:40:19.000Z","2026-11-11T03:41:53.500Z",[101],47,"公众号：千问APP","znkg4gbpmzwsegyun87hej1lp","OCC 发布监管框架，可自主移动资金的银行 AI Agent 被列入最高风险层级","美国国家银行监管机构 OCC 发布评估银行 AI Agent 的监管框架，依据 Executive Order 14434 要求，用 \"Super Intelligence\"（SI）一词涵盖此前所称的人工智能。框架将可自主移动资金的支付 Agent 列入最高风险层级，与实时信贷决策和金融市场准入同档。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T03:20:32.000Z","2026-11-11T03:47:44.887Z",[470,197],61,{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":505,"_99":86,"_100":-5},[506],{"_115":149,"_117":507,"_119":508,"_121":509,"_123":510,"_125":511,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=5dbd770b54dd501b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=7dfe944c4d75b8f9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=47cfe10007fb4af4 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=5dbd770b54dd501b 720w",1066,1411,"vrln9dterc8u3q8exet5pimqp","MiniMax H3 Image 图像模型在 Runware Day 0 上线","MiniMax 官方感谢 Runware 对 MiniMax H3 Image 的 Day 0 支持，该图像模型基于开源视频模型 H3 构建，定位广告创意、电商与规模化内容生产。官方称模型支持最多 16 张参考图输入，出图速度提升 2–3 倍；Runware 版本输出最高 20 MP，提供 1K/2K/4K 预设与 1:3 到 3:1 宽高比，H3 Image Highspeed 速度为 2 倍，图像输出 $3.80 每百万 token 起，两款模型 4K 输出 11 月 17 日前五折。",{"_103":530},"2026-11-11T03:43:19.000Z","2026-11-11T04:05:44.860Z",[479,340],60,{"_90":521,"_92":522,"_93":523,"_95":524,"_97":525,"_99":86,"_100":526},"MiniMax (official)","MiniMax_AI","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=88dd5bd9dc483876","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=14a8c0d27b515c98 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=88dd5bd9dc483876 96w",[],{"_90":527,"_92":528,"_145":529,"_147":-5},"Runware","runware","@MiniMax_AI H3 Image & H3 Image Highspeed are live on Runware on D0\n\nMiniMax built its new image model on H3, its popular open-weight video model, calling it the strongest open-weight image model released so far.\n\n- Edit with up to 16 reference images\n- Output up to 20 MP, with 1K, 2K and 4K presets or exact width and height\n- Aspect ratios from 1:3 to 3:1\n- H3 Image Highspeed runs at 2x the speed, for quick edits and fast iterations\n\nImage output from $3.80 per million tokens, with 50% off 4K outputs on both models through November 17","MiniMax","thu1nes9bh49ngumfxgvaa25f","MiniMax H3 Image 开放权重图像模型上线 fal，约 10 秒生成 4K 图像","MiniMax 宣布 H3 Image 图像模型在 fal 上线，官方称约 10 秒即可生成 4K 图像。模型能遵循复杂提示词、精确编辑，并支持游戏与 3D 资产生成，官方表示其速度足以支撑智能体和生产力工具。引用的 fal 介绍称其支持原生 4K 生成与编辑、多参考图组合及精确文本渲染。",{"_103":530},"2026-11-11T03:42:42.000Z","2026-11-11T04:05:44.869Z",[101,340],55,{"_90":521,"_92":522,"_93":523,"_95":524,"_97":540,"_99":86,"_100":541},[],{"_90":91,"_92":91,"_145":542,"_147":-5},"MiniMax H3 Image is now available on fal.\n\nThe latest open-weights image model from @MiniMax_AI delivers exceptional visual quality at lightning-fast speeds, with powerful generation and editing capabilities.\n\nGenerate and edit images in native 4K, combine multiple references, and render complex text with precision.","cj78tkkh6hnytvqy2ojn0tb34","Claude Fable 5.2 用代码吞噬审美，作者实测对比 Gemini 4 Carbon","作者实测 Claude Fable 5.2，认为其审美能力是 Benchmark 难以评估但明显超越同期上线的 Gemini 4 Carbon 的关键差异，并展示社区用其写 Python 控制 Blender 做动画、写代码作画的案例。其中一幅画作未用图像模型，纯代码模拟颜料引擎画了70万笔，作者据此判断大模型正借助代码吞嘝虚拟世界中原本被认为无法计算的美。",{"_103":559},"2026-11-11T04:03:33.000Z","2026-11-11T04:09:42.364Z","opinion",[557,292,558,317],{"_90":552,"_92":553,"_93":554,"_95":555,"_97":556,"_99":9,"_100":-5},"数字生命卡兹克","Khazix0918","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=dfb543046f73574a 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e 96w",[],"大佬观点","多模态","卡兹克","xshgfc1vcvgrdkvnomagmefwy","Anthropic 修订版 S1 文件披露与 Microsoft 和 Google 超 100 亿美元级新算力协议","Anthropic 在当日修订的 S1 文件中披露与 Microsoft 和 Google 达成超 100 亿美元的新协议。Microsoft 承诺到 2033 年 6 月支出至少 472 亿、最高 492 亿美元，Google 最低承诺从约 1145 亿升至约 1213 亿美元，两笔均不可撤销、无论是否使用容量都须付款。文件还提到上季度短期算力支出 50 亿美元且价格明显更高。","S1 修正案披露了 Microsoft 和 Google 云承诺的最新金额和不问使用照付的条款，可以据此理解 Anthropic 的算力开支结构。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T04:14:38.000Z","2026-11-11T04:18:44.594Z",[316,317,425,293],84,{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":570,"_99":86,"_100":571},[572],{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_145":308,"_147":309},{"_115":149,"_117":573,"_119":574,"_121":575,"_123":576,"_125":577,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=3296bae964314745","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=2ee72ef70228f062","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=a65560ec7ccd283c 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=3296bae964314745 720w",1228,1501,"mu4jpi0jbf4dph1o8d1lodxj6","研究：LLM 道德选择缺乏稳定价值排序","一项论文发现，LLM 的道德选择往往缺乏稳定的价值排序，对答案取平均会造出虚假的、类人的道德层级。研究者让包括 GPT-5.2、Gemini、DeepSeek 在内的 5 个 LLM 对成对道德违规行为做比较，并直接从 next-token 输出读取概率。",{"_103":166},"2026-11-11T04:08:45.000Z","2026-11-11T04:18:44.602Z",[177,178,593,293,294],{"_90":166,"_92":167,"_93":168,"_95":169,"_97":586,"_99":86,"_100":-5},[587],{"_115":149,"_117":588,"_119":589,"_121":590,"_123":591,"_125":592,"_127":-5,"_128":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=39bb113d167265a8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=503403f78906a6d3","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=e409fc659982c709 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=39bb113d167265a8 720w",1563,1566,"OpenAI","okbcich8urab84lqhg41q297l","Viggle JST-2 生成可动画 3DGS 角色场景","用我们的 JST-2 模型生成的可动画 3DGS 角色和场景 👀",{"_103":610},"2026-11-11T03:52:56.000Z","2026-11-11T04:18:47.073Z",[101,102],{"_90":602,"_92":602,"_93":603,"_95":604,"_97":605,"_99":86,"_100":606},"ViggleAI","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2103212981483896832%2F_Je68a_F_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=02ce7a38340dda9e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2103212981483896832%2F_Je68a_F_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=6998658d32b08bcc 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2103212981483896832%2F_Je68a_F_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=02ce7a38340dda9e 96w",[],{"_90":607,"_92":608,"_145":609,"_147":-5},"Nan Ha","nan_in_space","I used Fable 5.2 to build an interactive web piece where you walk a girl through eight worlds. Jump through a portal into each new one with a dive, a leap, or a cartwheel.\n\nThe girl and scenes are all 3DGS, each generated from a single image. \n\nBreakdown & playable link 🧵","Viggle AI","xdfuy23o82a5n5wjv75ya1lfj","三大场景横测 Seedream 5.5 与 GPT Image 2.6：30 轮改图不崩、27 图层一键分离","作者实测火山引擎新发布的 Seedream 5.5，与 GPT Image 2.6 在同一底图上连续修改 30 轮，Seedream 5.5 人物与画面保持稳定，Image 2.6 出现明显形变和油腻感。",{"_103":624},"2026-11-11T04:05:27.000Z","2026-11-11T04:34:42.777Z",[218,340,291],{"_90":619,"_92":620,"_93":621,"_95":622,"_97":623,"_99":9,"_100":-5},"卡尔的AI沃茨","aiwarts","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1685356596204040192%2FDYVeb0ww_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=d898f917214ca0c4","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1685356596204040192%2FDYVeb0ww_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=4db4e3504c4bbc31 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1685356596204040192%2FDYVeb0ww_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=d898f917214ca0c4 96w",[],"卡尔的 AI 沃茨","qdk4fnin9kq2znn7z12gffj6y","阿里 Qwen Code 1.0 发布：Qoder 与 Qwen Code Harness 能力融合开源","阿里发布 Qwen Code 1.0 Preview，将 Qoder 中打磨的 Harness 能力融入 Qwen Code 融合开源，为开发者提供可嵌入自身产品的 Agent 运行基础。",{"_103":272},"2026-11-11T04:20:07.900Z","2026-11-11T04:47:40.284Z",[101,281,197,292],69,"en4o1mjci8petvdc6m3wrbk09","OpenAI 在 AI Engineer Code Summit 讲解 Codex 云端、语音与 dots 新工作方式","Richard MacManus 报道 AI Engineer Code Summit 上 OpenAI 开发者体验工程师 Dominik Kundel 和 Charlie Guo 的 Codex 工作坊。",{"_103":640},"2026-11-11T04:49:48.000Z","2026-11-11T04:51:41.243Z",[218,197,292,593],"Latent Space","xh862prfqdnfa0mpystjxvcqr","AWS CEO Matt Garman 称未来几年算力仍将供不应求","AWS CEO Matt Garman 在访谈中表示，当前需求远超供给，预计算力短缺将持续未来几年。他还认为 AI 推理规模仍不到最终规模的 1%，AWS 正以每 14 秒增加一块 GPU 的速度扩容，并预计云业务未来五到十年可达每年 1 万亿美元收入。",{"_103":650},"2026-11-11T04:35:34.000Z","2026-11-11T05:05:28.446Z",[316],59,{"_90":650,"_92":651,"_93":652,"_95":653,"_97":654,"_99":86,"_100":655},"Alex Heath","alexeheath","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1983378648787988480%2FcGjEMRvw_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=e1d581e1039e0b6d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1983378648787988480%2FcGjEMRvw_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=367d8ad1238b793c 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1983378648787988480%2FcGjEMRvw_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=e1d581e1039e0b6d 96w",[657],{"_90":650,"_92":651,"_145":656,"_147":-5},"AWS CEO on building a $1 trillion business\n\nAmazon thinks its cloud business could generate $1 trillion a year within the next five to ten years. I sit down with AWS CEO @mattsgarman in Seattle to understand what gives him that confidence and what could get in the way.\n\nGarman explains how AI is pushing companies to move their core operations into the cloud, accelerating the business AWS spent two decades building. We discuss why he thinks inference, the computing required to run AI models, is still below 1 percent of its eventual scale. He says AWS is adding one GPU every 14 seconds and expects capacity shortages for another couple of years. I ask how he decides who gets the GPUs, why he holds capacity back for startups that don’t exist yet, and where he sees risk in the industry’s spending.\n\nRecorded right after the midterm elections, our conversation also covers the backlash against data centers, what the industry needs to do to win over communities, and why he sees deserts as more promising than space.\n\nI also ask about the reset inside Amazon’s Nova team and whether it still intends to compete at the frontier of AI. We get into selling Trainium chips outside AWS, the rise of inference providers like Baseten and Fireworks, and Amazon’s big research bet on using mathematical proofs to help AI agents follow rules.\n\nTimestamps:\n00:00 AWS’s trillion-dollar bet\n02:24 How AI is accelerating cloud growth\n09:33 The cost of scaling AI\n14:10 The risks of the compute boom\n17:02 Why inference is still early\n20:03 The backlash against data centers\n28:21 Data centers in space, oceans and deserts\n31:38 The rise of AI inference providers\n33:53 AWS’s full-stack strategy\n36:52 Why AWS is selling Trainium chips\n38:11 How AWS allocates scarce compute\n40:10 AWS’s frontier AI ambitions\n41:37 Making AI agents safe\n46:31 Open vs. closed AI models\n49:14 Running AWS inside Amazon\n\nLinks:\nSpotify: https://open.spotify.com/episode/4uEHhddFRexDy3dYiCMNYc?si=6oDh50TITACVfyZj3MawYw\nYouTube: https://youtu.be/1C_MErgk2Z0\nSubstack: https://sources.news/p/aws-ceo-matt-garman-1-trillion\nApple Podcasts: https://sources.news/p/aws-ceo-matt-garman-1-trillion\n\nThanks to the show’s sponsors: @mercury, @meetgranola , and @Atlassian",{"_115":116,"_117":658,"_119":659,"_121":660,"_123":259,"_125":260,"_127":-5,"_128":658},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=4c444c67adaebc6c","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=00ca7f3cc6cf5afd","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=c256e811b9c20b71 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=4c444c67adaebc6c 720w","qd3f4j2hd0t98tqf28iv7pu2j","百度发布 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，权重将于 11 月 25 日前开源","百度发布 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，是基于此前 Base 模型的首个后训练版本，总参数 280B、激活参数 14B，支持 1M 上下文。模型 API 已在千帆平台上线，权重将于 11 月 25 日前开源；官方展示了游戏开发、3D 建模、知识工作、视频创作等 Agent 场景成果，并称该版本为后训练中间版本，正式版仍将持续优化。","官方给出总参 280B、激活 14B、1M 上下文等规格和基准对比，可据此评估该模型在编码与 Agent 任务上的定位。",{"_103":668},"2026-11-11T05:31:29.313Z",[479,197,292,558],"百度文心 ERNIE 官方博客","all","tag","q","tab","time",{"_675":676,"_677":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
